ass=\"dcw-step-n\">1</div><div class=\"dcw-step-t\">Select a topic: Billing Inquiry, Damage, or Other.</div></div><div class=\"dcw-step\"><div class=\"dcw-step-n\">2</div><div class=\"dcw-step-t\">Describe the request, add a location, tags, and an optional file.</div></div><div class=\"dcw-step\"><div class=\"dcw-step-n\">3</div><div class=\"dcw-step-t\">Optionally provide contact information for a reply.</div></div><div class=\"dcw-step\"><div class=\"dcw-step-n\">4</div><div class=\"dcw-step-t\">Review and submit.</div></div></div><div class=\"dcw-screens is-3\"><div class=\"dcw-fig\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Completed details describing an unusually high bill, with the Billing tag selected.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-04-details-filled.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-title is-on-dark\">Details</div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Review screen listing description, topic, location and tags, each with Edit.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-06-review.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-title is-on-dark\">Review</div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Thank-you screen with a Submit Another Request button.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-07-submitted.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-title is-on-dark\">Submitted</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"dcw-strip-wrap\"><div class=\"dcw-strip-label is-on-dark\">All 7 screens <span class=\"dcw-strip-hint is-on-dark\">Scroll →</span></div><div class=\"dcw-strip\"><div class=\"dcw-strip-item\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Customer Service Form: &#x27;Please select a topic&#x27; with Billing Inquiry, Damage and Other.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-01-topic.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-text is-xs is-on-dark\">01 · Select a topic</div></div><div class=\"dcw-strip-item\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Billing Inquiry selected and the Next button enabled.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-02-topic-selected.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-text is-xs is-on-dark\">02 · Topic selected</div></div><div class=\"dcw-strip-item\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"&#x27;How can we help you?&#x27; text field, location field, suggested billing tags and file upload.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-03-details.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-text is-xs is-on-dark\">03 · Additional details</div></div><div class=\"dcw-strip-item\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Completed details describing an unusually high bill, with the Billing tag selected.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-04-details-filled.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-text is-xs is-on-dark\">04 · Details filled in</div></div><div class=\"dcw-strip-item\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Contact information form with name, email, phone and optional account number.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-05-contact.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-text is-xs is-on-dark\">05 · Contact information</div></div><div class=\"dcw-strip-item\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/68caf66283367e4c3b2f3706/6acc456fdd0c8e3018726091_dcw-ph-phone.png\" alt=\"Review screen listing description, topic, location and tags, each with Edit.\" data-asset=\"final-cs-06-review.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div><div class=\"dcw-fig-text is-xs is-on-dark\">06 · Review</div></div><div class=\"dcw-strip-item\"><div class=\"dcw-mock\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-body\"><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-btn-l\"></div><div class=\"dcw-mock-island\"></div><img class=\"dcw-mock-screen\" src=\"http